{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2026-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1780272000, "end_date": 1782863999, "month_true_total": 17, "quota": 17, "returned": 17, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:17:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "229126871", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146264113", "personaname": "HARLESSIN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/harlessin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 80, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 80, "last_played": 1782711514, "avatar": "a64e32a30325cd5e327de9186fe3242dc2ef1dc7"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Uno solo quiere entrar a disparar zombies y armar la estrategia para cumplir las misiones. Pero me encuentro con un p*to sistema de cartas y nose que pendejadas mas que hacen que la experiencia en mi caso sea muy tedioso. Tuve que solicitar el reembolso...", "timestamp_created": 1782711809, "timestamp_updated": 1782711809, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498381853103637695", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32370", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14650HX", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Laptop GPU", "vram_size": 7899}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229032279", "author": {"steamid": "76561199216191880", "personaname": "Mortal35", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199216191880/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2984, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2984, "last_played": 1739313895, "avatar": "d57a961c9c1565fc519559c7c9b631d37fb3069e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "es bastante bueno el modo campaña es